#| msgid "Before running on the real QPU, we verify that the circuit produces a Bell pair by testing it on a noiseless simulator with a four-qubit chain `[0, 1, 2, 3]`. We use the Qiskit Runtime `Sampler` with `AerSimulator` as the backend mode to execute the circuits.\n"
